---
description: TypeScript rules
globs: ["**/*.ts", "**/*.tsx"]
---
- Strict mode; no any (use unknown + narrowing); no @ts-ignore.
- Zod at every external boundary; infer types from schemas.
- Unions / as const over enums; named exports except Next.js special files.
- Typed result objects for expected failures. Run `pnpm typecheck` after edits.
